## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cFF1FB7EBMCL |cFFFFFFFF- Mount Collection Log
## Title-zhTW: |cFF1FB7EBMCL |cFFFFFFFF- 坐騎收集日誌
## Notes: A tool used to log collected mounts in a similar way to Simple Armory.
## Notes-zhTW: 一個用於記錄坐騎收集的工具，類似於Simple Armory。
## Version: 3.14.2
## DefaultState: enabled
## SavedVariables: MCL_DB, MOUNTLIST, MCL_PINNED, MCL_HIDDEN, MCL_SETTINGS, MCL_GUIDE_SETTINGS
## Author: Discord: https://discord.gg/ak2gma8enk
## Description: A tool used to log collected mounts in a similar way to Simple Armory.
## Description-zhTW: 一個用於記錄坐騎收集的工具，類似於Simple Armory。
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MCL\mcl-logo-32
## AddonCompartmentFunc: MCL_OnAddonCompartmentClick

# World of Warcraft: Forever (interface 16001, patch 1.60.1).
#
# Two files differ from MCL.toc:
#
#   core\ForeverData.lua       replaces core\data.lua.  Forever's mount table
#                              is its own - 144 mounts, 45 of them exclusive -
#                              and its collection is not shared with retail,
#                              so none of the retail expansion sections apply.
#
#   guide\ForeverGuideData.lua replaces the six retail guide data files.
#                              Those are retail map IDs and retail NPCs;
#                              Forever has its own UiMap namespace, so they
#                              would put every pin in the wrong place.
#                              This one is generated by
#                              dev/gen_forever_guide.py from a Wowhead
#                              scrape and carries real Forever map IDs and
#                              coordinates. The Guide's own code loads
#                              unchanged.

libs\load_libs.xml
locales\Locales.xml
core\locales.lua
core\button.xml
core\frame.xml
core\ForeverData.lua
core\Constants.lua
core\Themes.lua
core\Anim.lua
core\MountCache.lua
core\Widgets.lua
core\StylePicker.lua
guide\ForeverGuideData.lua
guide\MCL_Guide.lua
guide\GuideReputation.lua
guide\GuideZonePanel.lua
guide\GuideMapPanel.lua
guide\GuideStepTracker.lua
guide\GuideRouteCompass.lua
